{
  "chapter.756FE2AA913E8F06.title": "04 • DynEco: Trade and Play",
  "task.4A789DED52D7441A.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.3828E5DDA0C35009.title": "Start here: DynEco",
  "quest.3828E5DDA0C35009.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.3828E5DDA0C35009.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "DynEco adds an in-game market with simulated buyers, listings and changing prices. It helps turn surplus production into purchasing power. Gamble It is connected by your local addon to this same wallet; there is no separate deposit currency.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Your route: tablet and power -> inspect prices -> a small purchase and sale -> linked storage and automation -> wallet checks -> optional casino rules. No quest requires a gambling win.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Read the next guide card before building. This chapter teaches working setups; it does not replace JEI recipes or the mod's own manual."
  ],
  "task.2341213D399DE802.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.00762979529AB361.title": "How to use this guide",
  "quest.00762979529AB361.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.00762979529AB361.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "Arrows suggest a learning order. Item tasks check what you carry; a checkmark is your own confirmation of a practical step. Neither is proof that an entire machine or colony works.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Open a quest, read Why / Do / Tip, then click its item to inspect it in JEI. R shows recipes and U shows uses with the default bindings. Read ahead, complete the described experiment, and only then tick practical tasks. Items are not consumed.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Use JEI for this pack's quantities and substitutions. Pick a small test area and keep outputs visible. Existing equipment can count; briefly pick it up only when safe. Troubleshooting and a final project are at the end."
  ],
  "task.2151F8A945A8C6C4.title": "I completed the practical steps",
  "quest.4C37D18D9440A483.title": "Craft the Market Tablet",
  "quest.4C37D18D9440A483.quest_subtitle": "Practical checklist",
  "quest.4C37D18D9440A483.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "The tablet is the market interface. It needs energy, so crafting it alone is not enough to start trading.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Craft the Market Tablet with the current JEI recipe. Charge it in an FE charger, or use its supported redstone-block charging interaction, then right-click with it to open the market.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "If the interface does not open, check charge and the item's tooltip before changing economy settings."
  ],
  "task.12212E99DDB3B78A.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.4C47ACFC848D1DA7.title": "Know your wallet",
  "quest.4C47ACFC848D1DA7.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.4C47ACFC848D1DA7.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "A wallet balance is purchasing power, not inventory space. New DynEco accounts use the configured starting balance; this guide grants no extra credits.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Inspect your balance in the tablet and compare it with /dyneco balance. Note the display currency and base-credit value before testing transactions.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "The casino always uses whole base credits. A different DynEco display currency can make the displayed numbers look different without changing the underlying money."
  ],
  "task.4C5267F1A558E7A2.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.0DEDA51D16462441.title": "Read a price before buying",
  "quest.0DEDA51D16462441.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.0DEDA51D16462441.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "The broad market includes many machines and tools. A listed base item price is not a valuation of its enchantments, stored contents or upgrades.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Search a common resource and inspect its current buy/listing information. Compare a few related materials and choose an inexpensive test purchase.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Start with plain resources and empty replaceable machines. Do not use a unique upgraded tool as your first market experiment."
  ],
  "task.5A185C4B75A1632A.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.31A9161E3C2D2100.title": "Your first small purchase",
  "quest.31A9161E3C2D2100.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.31A9161E3C2D2100.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "A tiny purchase lets you verify price, quantity, payment and delivery before committing a large balance.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Buy a small quantity of an ordinary material. Check the confirmation, wallet change and delivered items. Locate the items before making a second order.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Read quantities carefully. If a transaction seems delayed, inspect the current screen and order state rather than repeatedly clicking buy."
  ],
  "task.573D8366E379BB5B.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.364B51AEDAF9422C.title": "List a surplus item",
  "quest.364B51AEDAF9422C.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.364B51AEDAF9422C.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "Selling to simulated buyers is not the same as instantly exchanging every stack for cash. Listings may need time to find buyers.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "List a small surplus stack of a common resource. Record the starting balance and quantity, then inspect the listing after time passes and confirm an actual sale.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Unsold listings are not earned credits. Keep materials needed for your next machine outside the first experiment."
  ],
  "task.69314B40D0BCEDF3.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.79902E2AE165400C.title": "Supply, demand and patience",
  "quest.79902E2AE165400C.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.79902E2AE165400C.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "Dynamic prices reward checking the market. Flooding one item or buying a large quantity can behave differently from a single small transaction.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Observe the same item across a few ordinary trades. Compare demand, available supply and the displayed price without assuming a fixed sell value forever.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Use the market to support your progression. A price derived from recipes is not a hand-balanced appraisal of every ATM10 machine."
  ],
  "task.3E95692AA58A91DE.title": "I completed the practical steps",
  "quest.3C3E8D6ACBA66724.title": "Link a storage chest",
  "quest.3C3E8D6ACBA66724.quest_subtitle": "Practical checklist",
  "quest.3C3E8D6ACBA66724.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "Linked storage makes repeated transfers easier, but the chosen chest should contain only the goods you intend to trade.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Place a dedicated trade chest and sneak-right-click it with the tablet to link it. Verify the selected storage and test with a few low-value items before setting automation.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Name or label the chest. Keeping your workshop's only tools in a trading chest is an easy way to sell something you still need."
  ],
  "task.50F979C1AEB65D9F.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.5A1FB2CD3C301F4B.title": "Automate one export",
  "quest.5A1FB2CD3C301F4B.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.5A1FB2CD3C301F4B.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "Automatic selling is most useful for genuine surplus from a renewable production line.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Configure one ordinary item for automatic selling from the linked storage. Feed it a small batch, observe listings and completed sales, and check the resulting wallet change.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Keep a reserve upstream. Let your production fill a buffer before diverting surplus to the trade chest."
  ],
  "task.1C37BEBB130DD2D2.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.7928D79F2D94447D.title": "Buy to a budget",
  "quest.7928D79F2D94447D.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.7928D79F2D94447D.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "Automatic buying should solve a known shortage without consuming the balance reserved for other projects.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Inspect the tablet's automatic-buy controls and configure a small bounded requirement if suitable controls are available. Otherwise use manual purchases. Verify the item and storage destination.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Do not enable an open-ended buying rule just to complete a quest. The goal is a predictable supply cost."
  ],
  "task.3967F4125DDECAE3.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.17036B4B0B368140.title": "When an item is missing",
  "quest.17036B4B0B368140.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.17036B4B0B368140.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "The broad-market rules still exclude selected creative/admin items and honor DynEco's deny lists. Some resources can also lack useful pricing data.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Check the item's exact ID with advanced tooltips and search again. If you have permission, /dyneco why <item_id> and /dyneco price <item_id> can explain eligibility or pricing.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "A missing market entry does not mean the item is absent from the pack. JEI and the mod's normal progression remain available."
  ],
  "task.26275FBEBAD938C9.title": "I completed the practical steps",
  "quest.5D7DB41591DF03FD.title": "Project: a modest trade loop",
  "quest.5D7DB41591DF03FD.quest_subtitle": "Practical checklist",
  "quest.5D7DB41591DF03FD.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "A useful economy setup has a clear input, retained reserves, sales and a practical purchase at the end.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Produce a renewable resource, keep a reserve, sell a small surplus and spend part of the proceeds on something your next project needs. Confirm that your remaining balance matches your expectations.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "This is the main economy capstone. Everything below is an optional casino guide and is not required for the trading workflow."
  ],
  "task.7A5D1018661F5D74.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.4DEC0220AF3FA45F.title": "Optional: open the casino",
  "quest.4DEC0220AF3FA45F.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.4DEC0220AF3FA45F.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "Gamble It provides several chance-based games. In this profile, the wallet bridge makes bets and winnings change DynEco directly.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Press F8 while in the world. If necessary, find Casino Mod > Open Casino in Controls. Compare the displayed whole-credit balance with your DynEco wallet before selecting a game.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "One casino credit equals one DynEco base credit; fractional cents stay in the wallet. The original item deposit/shop is disabled. Buy and sell through the Market Tablet."
  ],
  "task.3FD0CB86F3CE64EA.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.454FFCC7287165A0.title": "Optional: read a game first",
  "quest.454FFCC7287165A0.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.454FFCC7287165A0.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "A game's rules and payout display tell you what the selected stake means. Different games do not offer the same outcomes.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Open Coin Flip or Slots and inspect the bet controls, rules and displayed results. You can complete this reading task without placing a bet.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "A losing result is normal gameplay, not proof that the wallet bridge is broken. No strategy here promises profit."
  ],
  "task.5947CBD76805B5D2.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.754777A9B561B904.title": "Optional: staged rounds",
  "quest.754777A9B561B904.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.754777A9B561B904.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "Mines, Blackjack and Crash involve choices during a round. Their in-game cash-out controls remain available even though the separate item shop is disabled.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Read the chosen game's instructions and locate its round controls before starting. If you play, finish the round while connected and then inspect the wallet.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Gamble It discards unfinished sessions on logout without a refund. Close out active rounds before leaving the world."
  ],
  "task.06DA44C1F2641025.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.2EF47CB2F277BA8F.title": "Optional: a tiny wallet test",
  "quest.2EF47CB2F277BA8F.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.2EF47CB2F277BA8F.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "A controlled test checks integration without making a win a progression requirement.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "If you want to play, choose the smallest accepted stake and finish one round. Compare the wallet before and after, accounting for the displayed payout. Otherwise inspect the rules and acknowledge that you skipped the wager.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "Market sales can also change the balance while the casino is open. Use a quiet test period when checking the arithmetic."
  ],
  "task.4359BBA9ED6B5AFD.title": "I read and understood this guide",
  "quest.077709C3169232DC.title": "Optional: A useful stopping point",
  "quest.077709C3169232DC.quest_subtitle": "Guide and tips",
  "quest.077709C3169232DC.quest_desc": [
    "&6&lWHY&r",
    "The economy and casino share money. A budget for entertainment is separate from the resources you need to finish your colony or workshop.",
    "",
    "&a&lDO&r",
    "Choose a reserve for your next practical build and keep it available. Return to trading, crafting or exploration after your chosen session; the guide has no repeated betting or jackpot requirement.",
    "",
    "&e&lTIP&r",
    "If you need a repair, report the game, stake, before/after base-credit balance and whether automatic sales were active."
  ]
}
